SUMMARY:Deadline 23:59 EST: Mabou Mines SUITE/space Residency 2027-2029 (NY
 C early-career interdisciplinary performance\, two USD 4\,000 stipends)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 22 Nov 2026 at 23:59 EST.\n\nSUITE/space is Mabou Mines'
  two-year performance residency for early-career interdisciplinary artists
  in New York whose practices come from lived experiences at the margins. W
 HO: NYC-based early-career interdisciplinary performance artists. WHAT YOU
  GET: one of two USD 4\,000 stipends (subject to funding)\, 100 hours of r
 ehearsal space at Mabou Mines and technical support across the residency.\
 n\nOrganisation: Mabou Mines\nLocation: New York City\, USA. For NYC-based
  artists.\nAward: Two USD 4\,000 stipends (dependent on funding)\, plus 10
 0 hours of rehearsal space and technical support. No application fee.\nDur
 ation: 1 September 2027 to 30 June 2029\n\nMore: https://www.maboumines.or
 g/suitespace/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
